<s1>
<ptxt>
Measure clearance “a” between signal rotor (1) and exhaust CMP sensor (2).
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
If measured clearance is out of specification, replace camshaft or cylinder head.
</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>
Clearance between signal rotor and CMP sensor
</title>
<ptxt>
“a”: 0.2 – 1.5 mm (0.0079 – 0.0590 in.)
</ptxt>
</spec>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0A142119.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "68.399mm" ver = "01" gw = "185" gh = "177"/>
</figure>
</s1>
